---
source: crates/observed_macros_impl/tests/expansion.rs
expression: output
---
---- input ----
#[event()]
struct Subject { #[unredacted] v: u64 }

---- yields ----
`#[event(...)]` requires a string event name, e.g. `#[event("http.request")]`

---- input ----
#[event(bare_ident)]
struct Subject { #[unredacted] v: u64 }

---- yields ----
`#[event(...)]` requires a string event name, e.g. `#[event("http.request")]`

---- input ----
#[event(42)]
struct Subject { #[unredacted] v: u64 }

---- yields ----
`#[event(...)]` requires a string event name, e.g. `#[event("http.request")]`

---- input ----
#[event("e", bogus)]
struct Subject { #[unredacted] v: u64 }

---- yields ----
unknown `#[event(...)]` flag `bogus`; expected `disabled`
